WEBVTT

1
00:00.400 --> 00:02.869
In JavaScript the operators stay almost the same.

2
00:02.869 --> 00:11.731
But here seven divided by two gives three point five. There is only one type number, so there is no integer division.

3
00:11.731 --> 00:15.714
The percent sign gives the remainder of a division. It has nothing to do with percentages.

4
00:15.714 --> 00:20.217
Two asterisks is the power: two to the third is eight.
